        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(mattermost): cap opaque, outbound, and monitor resource caches",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes unbounded in-process Maps across Mattermost monitor and outbound paths:\n\n1. **Monitor channel/user caches** — per-monitor lookups with TTL but no size cap.\n2. **Outbound send caches** — bot user, user-by-name, channel-by-name, and DM channel caches.\n3. **Opaque target cache** — ID-shaped target resolution cache with no eviction.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nApplies `pruneMapToMaxSize` via shared cache-write helpers: monitor caches capped at **1 000**, outbound bot-user cache at **256**, other outbound/opaque caches at **1 024**.\n\n## User Impact\n\nLong-lived Mattermost gateways get bounded memory for monitor and outbound resolution caches. Normal workloads below the caps are unchanged.\n\n## Evidence\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs run \\\n  extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/target-resolution.test.ts \\\n  extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-resources.test.ts \\\n  --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\n- **Behavior or issue addressed:** Mattermost monitor, outbound, and opaque-target caches grew without bound.\n- **Real environment tested:** macOS (Darwin arm64), Node.js v22.22.0, local source checkout on branch `fix/mattermost-cap-process-caches`.\n- **Exact steps or command run after this patch:**\n  1. `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/target-resolution.test.ts extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-resources.test.ts --reporter=verbose`\n- **Evidence after fix:**\n\n```text\n ✓ evicts oldest opaque target cache entries once the cache exceeds its cap\n ✓ evicts oldest channel cache entries once the cache exceeds its cap\n\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  13 passed (13)\n```\n\n- **Observed result after fix:** Regression tests confirm oldest opaque-target and monitor channel entries are evicted at cap while newest entries remain cached.\n- **What was not tested:** Live Mattermost server websocket session or production gateway soak test.\n",
